# Tooling
# Local Claude Code state stays out wherever a .claude/ directory appears --
# including in a subdirectory Claude Code was run from. Only the repository
# root's shared skills are tracked. The leading **/ matters: a pattern with a
# slash in it is anchored to the root, so a bare .claude/* stops matching
# nested directories that the original .claude/ rule used to cover.
**/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
